摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DeepSeek Harness tools for self-hosted Gitea and Forgejo instances","id":"gh:1344637134","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-forge","slug":"maxmilian/dsh-forge","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","forgejo","gitea"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness tools for self-hosted Gitea and Forgejo instances"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-forge"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 繁體中文 | 简体中文 | 日本語"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Read-only DeepSeek Harness tools for\nself-hosted Gitea and Forgejo instances.\nThe plugin uses the RE"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"ST API shared by both projects and adds repository, issue, pull request,\nand Actions context directl"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"ared by both projects and adds repository, issue, pull request,\nand Actions context directly to DSH."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"> DeepSeek Harness is in developer preview. This plugin is tested with\n> `@deepseek-ai/dsh-tools 0.1"},{"id":"p5s2","text":".7-rc.2`, retains compatibility with the `0.1.0` prereleases from\n> `rc.6`, and may need updates whe"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"n Harness APIs change."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"- Inspect the configured instance version.\n- List repositories owned by the authenticated user.\n- Se"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"arch issues and pull requests across visible repositories.\n- Read an issue or pull request by reposi"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"tory and index.\n- Read pull request diffs and changed-file metadata.\n- List repository Actions runs "},{"id":"p7s4","text":"and jobs, then read plaintext job logs.\n- Localize runtime tool metadata in English, Traditional Chi"},{"id":"p7s5","text":"nese, Simplified Chinese, or Japanese.\n- Forward cancellation and enforce request time and response-"},{"id":"p7s6","text":"size limits.\n- Keep every v0.3 tool read-only and safe for parallel execution."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"From a local checkout:"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"From npm (recommended):"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"From the prebuilt release tarball:"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"The tarball includes compiled JavaScript and declarations, so installation does not run a local\nType"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"Script build. To track the repository instead:"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Git installations run the package `prepare` script. pnpm 10 may ask you to allow that build in the\np"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"rofile's `pnpm-workspace.yaml`; review and pin the source commit before allowing install-time code.\n"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"A published npm package or prebuilt tarball does not need that build permission."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## Configure"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Environment variables are preferred so the access token does not live in `cordis.patch.yml`:"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"`DSH_FORGE_URL` may include a subpath, such as `https://example.com/git`. The client preserves that\n"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"path when appending `/api/v1`. Public endpoints work without a token, but repository tools normally\n"},{"id":"p21s3","text":" appending `/api/v1`. Public endpoints work without a token, but repository tools normally\nneed one."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"The plugin can load before these variables are set. If a Forge tool is called without a configured\nU"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"RL, it returns an actionable configuration error instead of preventing the DSH profile from booting."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"The profile patch can override runtime limits or provide credentials directly:"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Use the narrowest token scopes your instance supports. Version 0.3 never creates, updates, merges,\nr"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"eruns, or deletes remote resources."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"`locale` controls model-facing tool descriptions, parameter help, and pending-call titles. English\ni"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"s the default; Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese, and Japanese are included without external\nt"},{"id":"p26s3","text":"ranslation services."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## Tools"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"| Tool | Purpose |"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"| `forge_instance_info` | Read instance version information |\n| `forge_list_repositories` | List rep"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"ositories owned by the authenticated user |\n| `forge_search_issues` | Search issues or pull requests"},{"id":"p29s3","text":" across repositories |\n| `forge_get_issue` | Read one issue |\n| `forge_list_pull_requests` | List re"},{"id":"p29s4","text":"pository pull requests |\n| `forge_get_pull_request` | Read one pull request |\n| `forge_get_pull_requ"},{"id":"p29s5","text":"est_diff` | Read one pull request as a unified diff |\n| `forge_list_pull_request_files` | List files"},{"id":"p29s6","text":" changed by one pull request |\n| `forge_list_action_runs` | List repository Actions runs |\n| `forge_"},{"id":"p29s7","text":"list_action_jobs` | List jobs belonging to one Actions run |\n| `forge_get_action_job_logs` | Read th"},{"id":"p29s8","text":"e plaintext log for one Actions job |"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"List endpoints clamp `limit` to 50 to keep model context bounded. API errors include the operation\na"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"nd HTTP status but never retain request headers or credentials."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"Node.js 22 or newer and Bun are required for development:"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"Unit tests mock `fetch`. The `Integration` GitHub Actions workflow additionally starts disposable,\no"},{"id":"p34s2","text":"fficial Gitea and Forgejo containers and their Actions runners. It creates real repositories,\nissues"},{"id":"p34s3","text":", branches, pull requests, workflow runs, and job logs before exercising the plugin client."},{"id":"p35s1","text":"## Compatibility verification"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"| Target | Verification |"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"| DeepSeek Harness | Local bundle install, composed-config dump, and boot smoke test |\n| Gitea | Liv"},{"id":"p37s2","text":"e CI against the official Gitea 1.27 container and Gitea Runner 3.1.0 |\n| Forgejo | Live CI against "},{"id":"p37s3","text":"the official Forgejo 16 container and Forgejo Runner 13.0.0 |"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"API payloads are returned as canonical JSON so fields added by either project remain available\nwitho"},{"id":"p38s2","text":"ut requiring a plugin release. Diff and log responses remain plaintext to avoid JSON escaping."},{"id":"p39s1","text":"## Current scope"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"The plugin deliberately uses the common REST endpoints instead of instance-specific extensions.\nActi"},{"id":"p40s2","text":"ons availability depends on the server version and whether Actions is enabled. A future release\ncan "},{"id":"p40s3","text":"add approval-gated writes, pull-request reviews, artifacts, and webhook-driven workflows."},{"id":"p41s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"MIT"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"Contributions are welcome. See CONTRIBUTING.md for the development workflow and\nSECURITY.md for priv"},{"id":"p43s2","text":"ate vulnerability reporting."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
